Usage: agent-deck session start <id|title> [options]

Start a session's tmux process.

Options:

Examples:
  agent-deck session start my-project
  agent-deck session start my-project --message "Research MCP patterns"
  agent-deck session start my-project -m "Explain this codebase"
  agent-deck session start my-project --message-file task.md   # long prompt from file, no shell quoting
  git diff | agent-deck session start my-project --message-file -   # initial message from stdin
